# Rollout Tracking — Plan Complete != Workspace Complete

When a plan is piloted on ONE repo, it is NOT complete for the workspace.

RULE: "Plan complete" = all in-scope repos updated, OR scope explicitly limited with a list of pending repos.

Track partial rollouts in `unified-trading-pm`:
```yaml
rollout-status:
  plan: quickmerge-ssot
  pilot-repos: [instruments-service]
  pending-repos: [list all remaining]
  completion-criteria: deployed to all N repos
```

In `unified-trading-pm/plans/ai/`: add a per-repo checklist at the bottom of the task doc.

The diff-checker and completeness-checker scripts also catch drift — but
PM tracking is the FIRST line of defense before scripts even run.

